<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Westpac arranges BOS Australia issue.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Westpac arranges BOS Australia issue.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westpac Banking Corp said on Friday it is arranging an US$500 million Euro-debt issurance programme for BOS International (Australia) Ltd.</p>
<p>Westpac said the notes were guaranteed by the Bank of Scotland.  </p>
<p>Westpac said this was BOS Australia's first offshore debt issuance programme following its domestic promissory note/medium term note programme in December last year.</p>
<p>It said the programme documentation was expected to be executed in Hong Kong at the end of November.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
